<title>UK: British Airways cuts European summer fares.</title>
<headline>British Airways cuts European summer fares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc unwrapped its summer price cuts for European fares on Wednesday, offering travellers reductions of up to 170 stg.</p>
<p>Under its latest batch of World Offer flights, BA said the special fares included a return ticket to Lisbon starting at 119 stg, saving around 170 stg and Barcelona from Birmingham at 129 stg, saving 134 stg.</p>
<p>Many of the discounted routes include those run by BA's franchise operator GB Airways. BA said the new fares would be available from Wednesday until July 2.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
